WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
There is a soul in the swing, where can it be left?

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,320
Jinqing Mountain God Land General of the Five Ways

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,320
The creation of gods is impermanent, the tea is lost and the soul is lost

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,320
return body

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,520
Open the gate of heaven and send souls from thousands of miles away

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:15,340
What's wrong with me? If it weren't for Xiaotie

7
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,780
Your soul is still floating outside now

8
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,420
You only have two immortal armors on you

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,620
You can only protect your family and should not take action.

10
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,620
Now they are still being tortured by outsiders.

11
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:26,210
I've thought about it, I want to clear the hall

12
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,970
I originally wanted to learn how others see things and make money.

13
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,470
But these days are floating outside

14
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,630
I figured it out too

15
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:33,590
I don't have this fate

16
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,940
I just want to live a good life

17
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,500
It's good to be like you

18
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,780
Live a normal life, live a stable life

19
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:43,620
Master Meng, it’s good to have you now.

20
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,100
Isn't this to comfort her?

21
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,060
Don't think too much

22
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:52,150
This class is mine

23
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:53,950
Don't fight. Don't fight. I'll move. I'll move.

24
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:55,910
It was Wei Qiuyu who asked me to come

25
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:58,590
She already knows that you are trying to clear the Yang family

26
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:00,850
She even knew I was coming today

27
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:05,770
He doesn’t seem to be a good tea person either.

28
00:01:05,770 --> 00:01:09,000
There is a black aura on her body, the aura of a resentful ghost.

29
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,640
Her home is also a ghost house

30
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,380
I cut off her financial resources

31
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:14,100
She will definitely come to the hall tonight
